{"run_id": "20260802T125238-hepkg", "qid": "gen-set-dfe30cf1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2ℓ SS Signal Region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2ℓ SS Signal Region\":\n\n1. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n3. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{W}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n5. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n7. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{p}}{\\mathup{p}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n9. **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n10. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese papers define the \"2ℓ SS Signal Region\" in their respective analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "2ℓ SS Signal Region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.126}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 63, "error": null, "seconds": 0.005}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-fiducial", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-2sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_pseudoscalar", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_scalar", "hepkg:region:SR-bWN", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_btag", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_softb", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_low", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_med", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:bbgamgam_vbf", "hepkg:region:bbzz_4l_sr", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:diphoton-baseline-sr", "hepkg:region:dl_search_region", "hepkg:region:dl_ss_control", "hepkg:region:ml-sr", "hepkg:region:os2l-sr", "hepkg:region:signal-region", "hepkg:region:signal-region-llp", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:signal_region", "hepkg:region:sl-sr", "hepkg:region:sl_search_region", "hepkg:region:sr-2b", "hepkg:region:sr-ee", "hepkg:region: