{"run_id": "20260802T125238-hepkg", "qid": "gen-set-f3db9ef1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Multijet background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 26 analyses that estimate the Multijet background. These analyses consistently use data-driven methods to estimate the background, involving the use of control regions in the data to infer the background contribution in the signal region. Some specific analyses include the CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement, combined measurements of Higgs boson production, constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum, and evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Multijet", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.088}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}, {"round": 4, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_mult