, "neutralino", "new", "non-prompt", "nonresonant", "normalized", "one", "opposite-charge", "other", "pair", "pairs", "parametrized", "particles", "partner", "penalty", "phenomena", "photon", "physics", "plus", "polarisation-coupling", "precise", "predictions", "probes", "processes", "produced", "production", "proton", "proton-proton", "ptv", "qcd", "quark", "quarks", "rare", "region", "resolved", "resolved-jets", "result", "result_estimates_background", "results", "rightarrow", "scalar", "search", "section", "sections", "selection", "shapes", "signals", "simulation", "single", "single-lepton", "spectra", "spin-correlation", "sqrt", "squarks", "state", "states", "supersymmetry", "t-channel", "tau_h", "tautau", "templates", "tev", "text", "than", "the", "theoretical", "three", "top", "transverse", "triboson", "ttbar", "tth", "ttz", "two", "twz", "tzq", "using", "vbf", "vector", "vector-like", "via", "vvv", "with", "ww-", "zgamma-"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 5, "prompt_tokens": 29499, "completion_tokens": 1930, "rounds": 5, "seconds": 82.54186758300057, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 82.54186758300057, "llm_calls": 5.0, "tokens": 31429.0, "rounds": 5.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.0, "set_recall": 0.0, "set_f1": 0.0, "tool_calls": 4.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 33.0, "evidence_quotes": 73.0}}
{"run_id": "20260802T125238-hepkg", "qid": "gen-set-fd24529e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2202.08676**: 3L ttZ control region\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ ttZ Control Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n  - 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\n- **2503.19420**: \n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, >=1 jet\n- **2508.13900**: 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n\nThese regions are defined in the respective papers and require the use of Large-R jets (anti-kT R=0.8).", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Large-R jet (anti-kT R=0.8)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "seconds": 0.196}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 463, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region